---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="SWR drainage | Flowin Pipes & Fittings" description="Explore Flowin SWR ring-fit and self-fit drainage systems, with verified ring-fit pipe tables and the full 2026 catalogue.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main>
    <div class="wrap product-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">SWR drainage</span></div>
    <section class="wrap range-hero" aria-labelledby="range-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Product system / 03</span><h1 id="range-title">SWR<br />drainage.</h1></div><div class="range-hero-side"><p>Explore the two SWR joint systems separately. Both ring-fit and self-fit pipe sizes and rates are available here; their fitting details remain in the original 2026 catalogue while those web tables are reviewed.</p><a class="text-link" href="/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf#page=10" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View SWR catalogue pages <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="wrap range-family-section" aria-labelledby="families-title"><div class="range-section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Explore SWR</span><h2 id="families-title">Choose the<br />joint system.</h2><p>Ring-fit and self-fit are distinct catalogue sections. Both pipe families now have source-checked tables.</p></div>
      <div class="family-card-grid">
        <a class="family-card family-card-featured" href="/products/swr/ring-fit-pipes/"><span class="family-number">01 / RING FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M27 16v88m22-88v88m26-88v88m20-88v88M20 16h36M20 104h36M68 16h34M68 104h34M27 32h22M75 32h20" /></svg></div><div><h3>Ring-fit pipes</h3><p>Six lengths, 75 and 110 mm, with single- and double-socket rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/self-fit-pipes/"><span class="family-number">02 / SELF FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M28 16v88m20-88v88m27-88v88m18-88v88M22 16h32M22 104h32M68 16h32M68 104h32M25 37h26M72 37h24" /></svg></div><div><h3>Self-fit pipes</h3><p>Single-socket Type A in 3 m and 6 m lengths, with 75 and 110 mm rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="range-catalogue-band"><div class="wrap range-catalogue-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">More SWR products</span><h2>Fittings stay in<br />the catalogue.</h2></div><div><p>Ring-fit bends, tees, reducers and accessories start on page 10; self-fit fittings continue on pages 11–12. Their web tables will be added only after review.</p><a class="solid-btn" href="/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf#page=10" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Browse 2026 catalogue <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  </main><SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
